          "settings": {
            "headline": "MATERIALS MATERIALS",
            "subtext": "<strong>Marketing Materials</strong> defines how your brand is built and used in the real world. This includes <strong>core logos, secondary marks, patterns, typography, and layout rules</strong>—based on an approved visual direction. We determine how the logo functions at different sizes, where and when marks are used, and how headlines and body copy work together.     The result is a <strong>clear</strong>, <strong>repeatable system that designers</strong>, <strong>vendors</strong>, and <strong>partners</strong> can <strong>execute without guesswork</strong>.This work becomes the foundation for all materials that follow, including <strong>guidelines, presentations, signage, and digital assets.</strong>",
            "heading_font": "sans_serif_n4",
            "text_color": "#14213d",
            "button_label": "CONTACT",
