    "blocks_EgnFN7": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_d76263e_QnMCmN": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_d76263e",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 1000,
            "section_padding": 60,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "columns_desktop": 2,
            "grid_gap": 30,
            "show_header": true,
            "eyebrow": "Editorial",
            "title": "The Business Case for Developers",
            "subtitle": "<p>Consistency = Value</p>",
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "header_spacing": 50,
            "eyebrow_color": "#999999",
            "eyebrow_size": 12,
            "title_color": "#121212",
            "title_size": 60,
            "subtitle_color": "#666666",
            "subtitle_size": 18,
            "show_image_1": true,
            "show_text_block_1": true,
            "text_heading_1": "Crafted Excellence",
            "text_body_1": "<p>High-performing developments are not built on trends—they are built on systems. Design principles rooted in discipline, restraint, and structure ensure that a brand remains legible, controlled, and valuable over time.</p><p>This approach draws from time-tested philosophies:<br/>Japanese design emphasizes reduction, intention, and respect for materials. Swiss design prioritizes clarity, hierarchy, and repeatable systems. Hermetic thinking reinforces cohesion—every element relates to the whole.</p><p>Together, these principles create brands that feel calm, confident, and deliberate rather than noisy or reactive.</p><h3>Front-Loaded Thinking, Long-Term Control</h3><p>The most effective brand systems do the hardest work upfront. Rules are defined early. Decisions are made intentionally. Visual elements are reduced to their essential forms.</p><p>This allows the brand to evolve over time without losing its identity. Materials can change. Applications can expand. Vendors can rotate. The core system remains intact.</p><p>For developers, this means fewer inconsistencies, fewer disputes, and fewer compromises as a project scales.</p><p></p>",
            "show_image_2": true,
            "show_text_block_2": true,
            "text_heading_2": "Timeless Design",
            "text_body_2": "<h3>Radical Consistency as Asset Protection</h3><p>Consistency is not aesthetic—it is operational. A clear, principled system prevents fragmentation across signage, marketing materials, tenant applications, and future phases of development.</p><p>Rather than reacting to each new need, the brand responds predictably, preserving perception and value. The result is a development that feels managed, intentional, and enduring—qualities that attract high-caliber tenants and partners.</p>",
            "image_height_desktop": 500,
            "image_height_tablet": 400,
            "image_height_mobile": 300,
            "image_fit": "cover",
            "text_block_padding": 20,
            "content_spacing": 40,
            "text_heading_color": "#121212",
            "text_heading_size": 28,
            "text_body_color": "#666666",
            "text_body_size": 16,
            "ball_color": "#fca311",
            "ball_size": 150,
            "ball_position_x": 50,
            "ball_position_y": 50
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "ai_gen_block_16c29fe_QqUYHf": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_16c29fe",
          "settings": {
            "show_header": true,
            "title": "Our Production Process",
            "subtitle": "From concept to completion, we bring your vision to life",
            "step_1_title": "Context + Site Analysis",
            "step_1_description": "<p>Reviewing existing <strong>brand systems</strong>, <strong>site conditions</strong>, and <strong>material requirements</strong> are evaluated to ensure all marketing materials align with <strong>scale</strong>, <strong>environment</strong>, and <strong>intended use</strong>. Basically still keeping the essence of your brand, as we want to avoid <strong>brand drifts!</strong></p>",
            "step_2_title": "Material + Layout Design",
            "step_2_description": "<p>Marketing assets are designed using high <strong>quality imagery</strong>, <strong>custom graphics</strong>, with <strong>production standards both modern and classic</strong>, ensuring consistency across <strong>print, digital</strong>, and <strong>environmental</strong> (wayfinding, and signages) and applications.</p>",
            "step_3_title": "Production & Fabrication",
            "step_3_description": "<p>Final files are prepared for print or fabrication, coordinating finishes, materials, and specifications. <strong> Production timelines and vendor coordination</strong> are managed to <strong>ensure materials meet specifications, </strong>quality expectations, and <strong>delivery schedules.</strong></p>",
            "step_4_title": "Delivery & Installation  (If Required)",
            "step_4_description": "<p>Materials are <strong>delivered</strong>, <strong>staged</strong>, or <strong>installed on-site as required</strong>, <strong>coordinated with insured third-party fabricators </strong>and installers to ensure <strong>proper placement,</strong> <strong>alignment</strong>, and <strong>presentation</strong>.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
